<title>FINLAND: Neste shares suspended on Helsinki bourse.</title>
<headline>Neste shares suspended on Helsinki bourse.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in shares of Finnish oil, chemicals and energy group Neste Oy was suspended on Tuesday at the company's own request, the Helsinki bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 242</p>
</text>
